      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, it's got a good mood. But looking at the preview in our tool, the richness score is actually pretty low—it's only flagging a handful of unique adjectives. \n\nThe brand really wants to emphasize the complexity and the \"layers\" of the scent. Could you try another version that's much more descriptive? I'm not saying make it a mess, but we definitely need to push that vocabulary score higher to get it noticed by the directors. Try to really lean into the sensory details of those notes.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
