    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's definitely getting more descriptive, which is good. But honestly, the richness score is still way lower than what we need for a \"high-end\" profile. The directors are really focusing on that metric to justify the budget for this campaign.\n\nCould you do one more version? Just really expand the adjective variety. Don't lose the elegance, but I need you to find more ways to describe those notes. If we can't get that vocabulary score up, they might think the copy is too \"simple\" for a luxury brand. Use every nuance you can think of to make the scent feel incredibly complex.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
